OL,3,GNEWSACatherine meets recovering addicts
OL,4,Aon garden visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FCatherine, Princess of Wales revealed
OL,7,Fher husband's green-fingered side as
OL,8,Fshe visited a garden and met people
OL,9,Frecovering from addiction.
OL,11,FAs patron of the Forward Trust - a
OL,12,Fcharity that supports recovering
OL,13,Faddicts - she spent time at its new
OL,14,Fgreen space in Southend-on-Sea, Essex.
OL,16,FThe princess described the planting
OL,17,Farea at Garon Park as a "fantastic
OL,18,Fspace" as she chatted with people who
OL,19,Fuse the garden to connect with nature.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
